{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bao Bao\u2019s Cozy Cleaning Services</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where things don\u2019t need to be perfect, just a little cleaner, a little calmer, and a little more you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're curled up with a podcast or just need something peaceful to help the world feel quieter, this gentle 2D pressure washing game is here for you. No timers, no stress, just pastel pixel art, soft sounds, and the satisfying swish of clean water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax Your Mind, One Splash at a Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ease your anxiety with every swipe of your washer. Let repetitive, simple tasks calm your thoughts while lo-fi beats and cozy visuals help you breathe a little deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/5e4a4578ac719470bfad6e5d11eef9f3.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Bao Bao Cleaning a dirty train\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/5e4a4578ac719470bfad6e5d11eef9f3.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/5e4a4578ac719470bfad6e5d11eef9f3.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play While You Listen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be the perfect companion game while listening to audiobooks, podcasts, or your own music. Drift away, one clean tile at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/1ae8591c7187e5ea3ec19978d0854629.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Bao Bao cleaning verandah of a house\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/1ae8591c7187e5ea3ec19978d0854629.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/1ae8591c7187e5ea3ec19978d0854629.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Comfort (Up to 4 Friends)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the best therapy is quiet time with people you love. Invite friends, clean together, and share the simple joy of making something beautiful again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Multiplayer gameplay\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soft Pastels, Gentle Pixels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of Bao Bao\u2019s world is drawn to soothe from peaceful parks to dreamy rooftops, the colors are kind to your eyes and your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lo-Fi for Low-Key Days</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted selection of 50 lo-fi tracks sets the mood for calm, cozy play, the kind that makes time feel like it\u2019s standing still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Bao Bao cleaning the living room\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessible and Kind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom key bindings, colorblind support, and more, because cozy should include everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Color Blind Mode Demo\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the <strong>Bao Bao franchise</strong>, this game was made with love for people who just need a little break. You're welcome here, just as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832380?t=1769068425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun