 Friends)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the best therapy is quiet time with people you love. Invite friends, clean together, and share the simple joy of making something beautiful again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Multiplayer gameplay\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/235e0c67fea94fef7f93bfd8955162f1.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soft Pastels, Gentle Pixels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of Bao Bao\u2019s world is drawn to soothe from peaceful parks to dreamy rooftops, the colors are kind to your eyes and your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lo-Fi for Low-Key Days</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted selection of 50 lo-fi tracks sets the mood for calm, cozy play, the kind that makes time feel like it\u2019s standing still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Bao Bao cleaning the living room\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/c2a1dcfd55c2a63149acca888ba09326.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessible and Kind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom key bindings, colorblind support, and more, because cozy should include everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.poster.avif?t=1769068425\" aria-label=\"Color Blind Mode Demo\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.webm?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/extras/48c2645177a62b1013c114c4017e2e65.mp4?t=1769068425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the <strong>Bao Bao franchise</strong>, this game was made with love for people who just need a little break. You're welcome here, just as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Destroyer Doggo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832380/2c59622bf296061c07637591e2a51217dbadf58f/header.jpg?t=1769068425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.0-1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> O